<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="435004755"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1159119870"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Sky is the Limit"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="FELT"/><amll:meta key="album" value="東方PARTYBOX2"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:24.000"><div begin="00:04.123" end="04:09.536"><p begin="00:04.123" end="00:06.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Nah (I'm not)</p><p begin="00:06.163" end="00:10.898" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">The man (Nobody on this Earth)</p><p begin="00:10.898" end="00:11.622" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">You know how that go</p><p begin="00:11.622" end="00:14.564" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Now I'm living with a purpose, I ain't perfect</p><p begin="00:14.564" end="00:17.494" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Allah got me, ain't spend too much time in churches</p><p begin="00:17.494" end="00:21.521" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">This from the heart, I ain't spend too much time rehearsing</p><p begin="00:21.521" end="00:23.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I was really thinking rob before I purchase</p><p begin="00:23.690" end="00:26.717" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">I was really thinking God, these niggas thirsty</p><p begin="00:26.717" end="00:29.365" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Paranoid around soft niggas, they make me nervous</p><p begin="00:29.365" end="00:32.392" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Clutching a pistol around these clowns, this shit a circus<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在闪烁的夜空下</span></p><p begin="00:32.392" end="00:35.229" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">If you knew my life you would understand, I deserve it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄悄将思念重叠</span></p><p begin="00:35.229" end="00:38.206" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Nobody gave me shit, told me I was worthless</p><p begin="00:38.206" end="00:41.202" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Felt like I was cursed until the day that paper surfaced<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管会滴落一滴泪</span></p><p begin="00:41.202" end="00:44.056" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">It's a reason why me and Beans can relate in person</p><p begin="00:44.056" end="00:47.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I'm cut from that cloth, all that talking'll get your murdered<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">背靠逐渐斑驳的墙壁</span></p><p begin="00:47.257" end="00:50.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">I relaxed on that juice, them percocets be testing me</p><p begin="00:50.430" end="00:53.092" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Plus your bitch keep texting me, I ain't attracted sexually</p><p begin="00:53.092" end="00:56.197" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">These niggas selling blow up, got the fiends frustrated<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我们定能展翅翱翔</span></p><p begin="00:56.197" end="00:59.346" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Trying to get this dough up, package on me, ratchet on me</p><p begin="00:59.346" end="01:01.478" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Tell me what your life like cause mines is real<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的目标正是</span></p><p begin="01:01.478" end="01:04.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Every thing signed and sealed, my mind on pills<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那闪烁的星辰</span></p><p begin="01:04.550" end="01:07.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Niggas'll rat on they own mother, they see that time get real<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸手仿佛就能触及</span></p><p begin="01:07.369" end="01:11.958" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Teddy bears and candle lightings give your moms the chills, for real<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">视线的前方</span></p><p begin="01:10.989" end="01:14.117" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">As far as I can remember, I've been a real one<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照亮的光芒</span></p><p begin="01:14.117" end="01:16.996" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">They say that pressure bust pipes but I don't feel none<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这片天空下</span></p><p begin="01:16.996" end="01:19.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Just like these whack-ass rappers I can't feel one<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就用这双翅膀</span></p><p begin="01:19.940" end="01:23.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">You said you wanted the real back, well, here it come<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你飞向更高更远</span></p><p begin="01:23.321" end="01:25.096" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Pressure's on once again but I embrace it</p><p begin="01:25.096" end="01:28.515" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I weathered though the storm before, I'm never breaking</p><p begin="01:28.515" end="01:31.771" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">I do this for the youth in the Matrix who won't make it</p><p begin="01:31.771" end="01:34.562" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I tell 'em every knock is a boost, remain patient</p><p begin="01:34.562" end="01:37.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">But every move he make is calculated through his hunger</p><p begin="01:37.818" end="01:41.121" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">It's sad to say shorty might not make it through the summer</p><p begin="01:41.121" end="01:43.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">His mom turned tricks for a fix, the pills strung her</p><p begin="01:43.639" end="01:46.619" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">He only met his pop for flicks and a jail jumper</p><p begin="01:46.619" end="01:48.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">His stomach empty but his clip full</p><p begin="01:48.940" end="01:54.124" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">He pop Xannies by the fistfull, drink syrup and skip school</p><p begin="01:54.124" end="01:55.907" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Pants hanging off his ass, ain't been in the bath</p><p begin="01:55.907" end="01:58.636" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">I try to steer 'em right 'cause i hate to see him crash</p><p begin="01:58.636" end="02:01.129" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Tell him just stay in his lane and remain humble<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同被指引着，一步步走到今天。</span></p><p begin="02:01.129" end="02:04.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">You bound to get hit in the game, just don't fumble<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛被指引般</span></p><p begin="02:04.188" end="02:07.156" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">I seen Gs drop the ball and straight crumble<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一步步走到如今</span></p><p begin="02:07.156" end="02:10.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Just know, if your aunt had a dick, she'd be your uncle<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管前路仍不清晰</span></p><p begin="02:10.150" end="02:12.821" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">What your life like, nigga, mines is real</p><p begin="02:12.821" end="02:16.016" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">No if, mights, maybes, probably, wills</p><p begin="02:16.016" end="02:18.864" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">I blow your fuckin' head off with that revolver steel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有这份坚定的</span></p><p begin="02:18.864" end="02:21.858" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">I shot a nigga on tour, got that revolver still<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是可确信的希望</span></p><p begin="02:21.858" end="02:24.702" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Know when you fuckin' with the Bully you involved with real<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并且一定长存于我的心中。</span></p><p begin="02:24.702" end="02:28.139" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">I put your body somewhere, they won't solve your kill, nigga</p><p begin="02:28.139" end="02:30.868" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">You need to stop it, thinkin' Mac won't pop it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这片天空下</span></p><p begin="02:30.868" end="02:33.723" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">Have your mom in all black out casket shopping<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想带你远走高飞</span></p><p begin="02:33.723" end="02:36.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">It's the Broadstreet Bully and Dave East, yeah, we playin' for keeps<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就用这双翅膀</span></p><p begin="02:36.473" end="02:39.972" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">These Niggas dressin' like freaks and they callin' the fleek<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们展开双翼追寻着梦想</span></p><p begin="02:39.919" end="02:42.404" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">These niggas be signing sheets, plus they callin' police</p><p begin="02:42.870" end="02:45.288" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">Know every nigga in the ghetto ain't involved in the streets</p><p begin="02:45.288" end="02:48.206" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">We ain't really into the games, we gon' rest you to peace</p><p begin="02:48.206" end="02:51.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">Pull something big out, give you a long kiss on the cheek</p><p begin="02:51.215" end="02:54.248" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">Who ready to die? Sky's the limit,  who want beef?</p><p begin="02:54.248" end="02:58.472" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">I was a bad boy before I repped the ROC</p><p begin="02:58.472" end="03:00.249" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">This ain't nothin' new, shit this just what the fuck we do</p><p begin="03:00.249" end="03:03.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">We like No Limit Soldiers and nigga, I'm that true</p><p begin="03:03.003" end="03:05.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">The reason, the solution, nigga I'm that too</p><p begin="03:05.262" end="03:09.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">Whoever stuck to the realness then I'm that glue</p><p begin="03:09.130" end="03:12.648" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">It's a war goin' on outside you ain't safe from</p><p begin="03:12.648" end="03:15.547" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">You can play Superman, you get your cape hung</p><p begin="03:15.547" end="03:18.498" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">We don't start no shit and we don't take none</p><p begin="03:18.498" end="03:21.614" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">We just 100% until our day come</p><p begin="03:21.614" end="03:24.339" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">As far as I can remember, I've been a real one</p><p begin="03:24.339" end="03:27.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69">They say that pressure bust pipes but I don't feel none</p><p begin="03:27.304" end="03:30.223" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L70">Just like these whack-ass rappers, I can't feel one</p><p begin="03:30.223" end="03:33.553" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L71">You said you wanted the real back, well, here it come</p><p begin="03:33.553" end="03:37.174" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L72">As far as I can remember, I've been a real one</p><p begin="03:37.174" end="03:39.305" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L73">They say that pressure bust pipes but I don't feel none</p><p begin="03:39.305" end="03:42.256" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L74">Just like these whack-ass rappers, I can't feel one</p><p begin="03:42.256" end="03:45.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L75">You said you wanted the real back, well, here it come</p><p begin="03:45.777" end="03:48.279" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L76">You said you wanted the real back, well, here it come</p><p begin="03:48.279" end="03:51.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L77">You said you wanted the real back, well, here it come</p><p begin="03:51.207" end="03:53.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L78">You said you wanted the real back, well, here it come</p><p begin="03:53.980" end="03:56.827" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L79">You said you wanted the real back, well, here it come</p><p begin="03:56.827" end="04:03.419" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L80">You said you wanted the real back, well, here it come</p><p begin="04:03.419" end="04:09.536" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L81">You said you wanted the real back, well, here it come</p></div></body></tt>